MID_MV13_06: <SH>
MID_MV13_06_m002: (grunt exert)
MID_MV13_06_m003: A lui ci penso io.
MID_MV13_06_m004: (growling)
MID_MV13_06_m005: (closed-mouth grunt)
MID_MV13_06_m006: (battle roar)
MID_MV13_06_m007: (light effort exert)
MID_MV13_06_m008: (exert as she takes a stance)
MID_MV13_06_m009: (attack exerts)
MID_MV13_06_m010: (attack exerts)
MID_MV13_06_m011: Quel tipo... combatte come se avesse in ballo\nun carico di tesori. Forse conosce la regina?
MID_MV13_06_m012: (power-building exert)
MID_MV13_06_m013: (block exert)
MID_MV13_06_m014: (straining exert)
MID_MV13_06_m015: (straining exert)
MID_MV13_06_m016: Hai una forza sovrumana...\nHa la stessa origine della mia?
MID_MV13_06_m017: (exert as he tumbles away)
MID_MV13_06_m018: (dodge exert)
MID_MV13_06_m019: (grunts of pain)
MID_MV13_06_m020: (small exhale)
MID_MV13_06_m021: (small, satisfied exhale)
MID_MV13_06_m022: Ti sono debitrice.
MID_MV13_06_m023: Aspettate a ringraziarmi.\nPrima dobbiamo vincere.
MID_MV13_06_m024: (groan as he stands)
MID_MV13_06_m025: Quel volto... Io ti conosco.
MID_MV13_06_m026: (pained sound)
MID_MV13_06_m027: Quello sguardo omicida... non potrei\nmai dimenticarlo. Bahr Vahn!
MID_MV13_06_m028: La voce mi parla ancora. La sento...
MID_MV13_06_m029: Il potere del tuo braccio sarà mio... Solo\nallora potrò essere un vero dio demoniaco!
MID_MV13_06_m030: Metterò fine ai tuoi vaneggiamenti.
MID_MV13_06_m031: (pained sounds)
MID_MV13_06_m032: In questo scontro... noto che ci somigliamo.
MID_MV13_06_m033: (dark chuckling)